# Keeps the build context small for the two Go services, which build from
# the repo root (they need go.work + pkg/sharding as siblings). Without
# this, every `docker build` would ship the whole repo -- including other
# services' node_modules/target/bin -- to the Docker daemon first.
.git/
logs/
.pids/
**/bin/
**/target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
**/data/cold-tier/
envoy/certs/
*.md
doc/
